00:01:32.246 --> 00:01:35.584
=Flying Up Without Disturb=

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.976
=Episode 5=

00:01:47.988 --> 00:01:49.068
Huan Zong?

00:01:50.749 --> 00:01:51.749
Huan Zong.

00:01:52.908 --> 00:01:53.708
Huan Zong.

00:01:55.869 --> 00:01:56.908
Why are you here?

00:01:56.908 --> 00:01:58.188
I was about to ask you.

00:01:58.188 --> 00:01:59.348
Why are you here?

00:01:59.348 --> 00:02:00.188
I live here.

00:02:00.348 --> 00:02:01.708
I live here too.

00:02:01.908 --> 00:02:02.828
I thought

00:02:02.828 --> 00:02:04.029
I wouldn't see you again

00:02:04.029 --> 00:02:04.669
since we didn't

00:02:04.669 --> 00:02:05.949
set a specific time or place.

00:02:06.309 --> 00:02:07.109
Looking for me?

00:02:07.109 --> 00:02:08.109
Of course.

00:02:08.268 --> 00:02:09.189
This afternoon,

00:02:09.189 --> 00:02:10.669
I left in too much of a hurry.

00:02:10.669 --> 00:02:11.629
But who would've guessed

00:02:11.629 --> 00:02:13.349
we actually have such fate

00:02:13.469 --> 00:02:14.548
to meet here?

00:02:14.588 --> 00:02:15.469
Wait for me.

00:02:15.469 --> 00:02:16.949
I'm coming to see you right now.

00:02:41.868 --> 00:02:43.308
What are you doing, Lin Hu?

00:02:43.588 --> 00:02:44.469
Master Zong,

00:02:44.588 --> 00:02:46.148
you don't actually believe

00:02:46.268 --> 00:02:47.428
what she just said, do you?

00:02:47.669 --> 00:02:49.308
She might have been
in too much of a rush

00:02:49.588 --> 00:02:51.148
and forgot to set a place with me.

00:02:51.868 --> 00:02:53.069
Oh, come on.

00:02:53.069 --> 00:02:53.868
I told you.

00:02:53.868 --> 00:02:55.748
If she really saw you
as a friend, she'd...

00:02:56.669 --> 00:02:57.229
Never mind.

00:02:57.629 --> 00:02:59.148
You always delude yourself anyway.

00:03:01.148 --> 00:03:01.949
I heard that.

00:03:20.349 --> 00:03:21.509
Who are you?

00:03:21.509 --> 00:03:23.189
I was about to ask you the same thing.

00:03:23.428 --> 00:03:25.389
Could I have been mistaken?

00:03:26.069 --> 00:03:27.868
Sorry! My apologies.

00:03:46.028 --> 00:03:48.229
Huan Zong. Huan Zong.

00:03:48.548 --> 00:03:49.389
Huan Zong.

00:03:51.588 --> 00:03:52.748
Why is it you again?

00:03:52.748 --> 00:03:53.509
Lady,

00:03:53.588 --> 00:03:55.028
may I ask what exactly do you want?

00:03:55.028 --> 00:03:56.389
I-I'm sorry! So sorry!

00:03:56.389 --> 00:03:56.949
Senior,

00:03:56.949 --> 00:03:57.828
I didn't mean to.

00:03:57.828 --> 00:03:58.708
From now on, I'll...

00:04:04.868 --> 00:04:06.548
Well done, Huan Zong.

00:04:06.748 --> 00:04:08.389
You actually dared to kid me.

00:04:13.509 --> 00:04:15.109
This is absolutely hilarious!

00:04:15.109 --> 00:04:16.349
That's enough.

00:04:16.909 --> 00:04:17.589
Master Zong,

00:04:17.589 --> 00:04:19.308
I was helping you vent your anger.

00:04:19.308 --> 00:04:21.469
Do I look like I need your help?

00:04:21.628 --> 00:04:22.428
Anyway,

00:04:22.428 --> 00:04:23.909
even if what she said earlier

00:04:23.909 --> 00:04:24.628
was all true,

00:04:24.628 --> 00:04:25.428
her presence here

00:04:25.428 --> 00:04:26.789
must be out of ulterior motives.

00:04:26.948 --> 00:04:27.589
Besides,

00:04:27.709 --> 00:04:28.829
didn't her master say

00:04:28.829 --> 00:04:31.149
she's just using you?

00:04:31.948 --> 00:04:33.308
Whether it's using or not,

00:04:33.589 --> 00:04:35.029
I'll know it after meeting her.

00:04:43.029 --> 00:04:43.829
Come in.

00:04:44.229 --> 00:04:45.589
Why mess with me like this?

00:04:45.709 --> 00:04:46.269
Huan Zong,

00:04:46.269 --> 00:04:47.548
don't you want to see me?

00:04:48.188 --> 00:04:49.029
Yes, I do.

00:04:49.029 --> 00:04:50.068
Then why did you...

00:04:53.188 --> 00:04:54.909
Could it be

00:04:55.068 --> 00:04:55.988
that you got angry

00:04:55.988 --> 00:04:57.229
because I left in such a hurry

00:04:57.388 --> 00:04:58.748
this afternoon?

00:05:01.068 --> 00:05:04.269
So you wanted to punish me?

00:05:04.909 --> 00:05:06.469
I thought you didn't want to see me.

00:05:06.548 --> 00:05:07.868
That's not true!

00:05:07.988 --> 00:05:09.508
How could I not want to see you?

00:05:09.628 --> 00:05:10.789
I really

00:05:10.789 --> 00:05:11.829
was being too careless.

00:05:11.829 --> 00:05:13.068
I was just saying earlier

00:05:13.068 --> 00:05:14.308
that I was about to find you.

00:05:15.589 --> 00:05:16.388
Come in first.

00:05:16.948 --> 00:05:17.909
Let's talk inside.

00:05:20.909 --> 00:05:21.909
Long time no see.

00:05:22.829 --> 00:05:24.068
It's late at night.

00:05:24.109 --> 00:05:25.029
Why does a young lady

00:05:25.029 --> 00:05:26.188
like you come here?

00:05:26.269 --> 00:05:28.589
I'm obviously here to see Huan Zong.

00:05:29.188 --> 00:05:31.229
Huan Zong, listen.

00:05:31.229 --> 00:05:32.349
Since leaving the mountain,

00:05:32.349 --> 00:05:33.548
I've encountered so many

00:05:33.548 --> 00:05:34.868
interesting things.

00:05:36.508 --> 00:05:38.349
By the way, Huan Zong,

00:05:38.469 --> 00:05:40.628
how are your injuries?

00:05:40.909 --> 00:05:42.188
Has your martial uncle

00:05:42.188 --> 00:05:43.709
collected all those spirit herbs?

00:05:43.709 --> 00:05:44.909
It's not that easy.

00:05:44.909 --> 00:05:45.669
If it were simple,

00:05:45.669 --> 00:05:46.868
would we need to come here?

00:05:49.868 --> 00:05:50.829
It's okay.

00:05:50.988 --> 00:05:52.269
Can't rush it.

00:05:52.428 --> 00:05:53.548
If you really

00:05:53.548 --> 00:05:54.308
feel uncomfortable,

00:05:54.308 --> 00:05:55.748
I can help you regulate your energy.

00:05:58.068 --> 00:05:59.589
I knew it!

00:05:59.589 --> 00:06:01.349
Straight to energy regulation.

00:06:02.428 --> 00:06:03.948
Did you come just to say that?

00:06:05.269 --> 00:06:06.269
I know

00:06:06.269 --> 00:06:08.149
you don't want to do this either.

00:06:08.349 --> 00:06:09.149
But

00:06:09.149 --> 00:06:10.789
with my current spiritual energy,

00:06:10.789 --> 00:06:12.709
even if I wanted to help you,

00:06:12.709 --> 00:06:14.308
I might not be able to do it.

00:06:14.308 --> 00:06:15.428
My master feared

00:06:15.428 --> 00:06:16.948
I'd be struck by thunder.

00:06:16.948 --> 00:06:18.789
So he sealed several
of my major acupoints.

00:06:18.909 --> 00:06:19.748
Now, I'm not

00:06:19.748 --> 00:06:20.589
the same as before.

00:06:20.589 --> 00:06:22.388
Even if I caught you,

00:06:22.388 --> 00:06:23.388
I might not be able

00:06:23.428 --> 00:06:24.748
to absorb spiritual energy.

00:06:25.868 --> 00:06:28.789
Listen to that. She's still lying.

00:06:28.789 --> 00:06:29.909
Anything else?

00:06:31.188 --> 00:06:32.068
Anything...

00:06:32.188 --> 00:06:34.269
Anything else?

00:06:34.469 --> 00:06:35.628
Forget it then.

00:06:37.469 --> 00:06:38.589
(Huan Zong must be having)

00:06:38.589 --> 00:06:39.909
(a hard time finding the herbs.)

00:06:40.029 --> 00:06:41.149
(That's why he looks)

00:06:41.149 --> 00:06:42.149
(so upset.)

00:06:42.269 --> 00:06:43.469
(I should cheer him up.)

00:06:44.829 --> 00:06:45.868
Huan Zong. Huan Zong.

00:06:45.868 --> 00:06:46.909
You know what?

00:06:46.909 --> 00:06:48.308
The room next to mine

00:06:48.308 --> 00:06:49.269
has a bird living in it.

00:06:49.269 --> 00:06:51.068
It's super noisy.

00:06:51.628 --> 00:06:53.308
Let me imitate it for you.

00:06:54.909 --> 00:06:57.589
Alone I lie. Alone I rise.

00:06:57.589 --> 00:06:58.669
Alone I sit.

00:06:58.669 --> 00:07:01.508
Who suffers loneliness like me?

00:07:01.709 --> 00:07:03.109
It even sings.

00:07:03.229 --> 00:07:04.548
Isn't that fascinating?

00:07:04.669 --> 00:07:06.988
They say it's a phoenix.

00:07:08.109 --> 00:07:09.029
Phoenix?

00:07:09.868 --> 00:07:11.149
A phoenix lives next to you?

00:07:11.269 --> 00:07:11.948
Exactly!

00:07:12.029 --> 00:07:13.149
So that means

00:07:13.149 --> 00:07:14.508
the phoenix is across from us?

00:07:14.589 --> 00:07:15.349
What?

00:07:15.349 --> 00:07:17.229
You're interested in the phoenix?

00:07:17.349 --> 00:07:19.109
That's no ordinary phoenix.

00:07:19.109 --> 00:07:20.948
That's the Azure Phoenix!

00:07:20.948 --> 00:07:21.669
Its feathers

00:07:21.669 --> 00:07:22.388
are an ingredient

00:07:22.388 --> 00:07:23.388
for Master's medicine.

00:07:23.508 --> 00:07:24.948
It's a medicinal ingredient?

00:07:25.829 --> 00:07:27.229
I'll go back right now

00:07:27.229 --> 00:07:28.909
and quietly...

00:07:28.909 --> 00:07:29.589
Enough.

00:07:30.109 --> 00:07:31.388
Stop being impulsive.

00:07:31.548 --> 00:07:32.388
No.

00:07:32.388 --> 00:07:33.349
I mean

00:07:33.349 --> 00:07:34.029
I'll negotiate

00:07:34.029 --> 00:07:35.388
with it properly.

00:07:35.388 --> 00:07:37.029
It keeps me awake all night.

00:07:37.029 --> 00:07:38.669
What's wrong with taking some feathers?

00:07:40.029 --> 00:07:41.948
Those aren't ordinary feathers.

00:07:42.469 --> 00:07:44.029
Just wait for my good news.

00:07:47.669 --> 00:07:48.669
I told you.

00:07:48.669 --> 00:07:49.988
She came for energy regulation.

00:07:50.068 --> 00:07:51.068
You don't believe me!

00:07:51.068 --> 00:07:51.868
Huan Zong.

00:07:53.149 --> 00:07:55.149
Your concealment spell works great.

00:07:55.149 --> 00:07:56.149
Can you teach me?

00:07:57.388 --> 00:07:58.188
No.

00:07:59.508 --> 00:08:02.029
Huan Zong, please teach me.

00:08:02.029 --> 00:08:03.388
Huan Zong,

00:08:03.508 --> 00:08:04.628
teach me, please.

00:08:05.748 --> 00:08:06.628
Lin Hu,

00:08:07.068 --> 00:08:07.829
you teach her.

00:08:12.149 --> 00:08:14.229
This concealment spell really works.

00:08:14.349 --> 00:08:16.068
Now that I'm in a good mood,

00:08:16.068 --> 00:08:17.229
the phoenix's singing

00:08:17.229 --> 00:08:18.709
doesn't even feel annoying anymore.

00:08:22.589 --> 00:08:24.188
Phoenix. Phoenix.

00:08:24.308 --> 00:08:25.469
Azure Phoenix.

00:08:26.829 --> 00:08:27.868
What now?

00:08:29.109 --> 00:08:30.988
You've been singing all night.

00:08:31.109 --> 00:08:32.189
Aren't you tired?

00:08:32.349 --> 00:08:34.469
Can't I sing to relieve boredom?

00:08:34.868 --> 00:08:36.589
If you're bored,

00:08:36.589 --> 00:08:38.508
how about I chat with you?

00:08:38.788 --> 00:08:40.549
Then come over here.

00:08:59.189 --> 00:09:01.469
Why is there another barrier here?

00:09:01.788 --> 00:09:03.148
They set it up.

00:09:03.148 --> 00:09:04.668
I'm suffocating in confinement.

00:09:04.788 --> 00:09:05.748
No wonder

00:09:05.748 --> 00:09:07.508
you sing nonstop at night.

00:09:08.268 --> 00:09:09.429
But

00:09:09.788 --> 00:09:12.429
you look unique.

00:09:12.429 --> 00:09:13.949
What good does being unique do?

00:09:14.109 --> 00:09:15.668
I'm going to die soon.

00:09:16.748 --> 00:09:18.189
Are you sick?

00:09:18.748 --> 00:09:20.949
People from Zhaohan Sect
want to kill me.

00:09:21.268 --> 00:09:22.508
Haven't you heard?

00:09:22.508 --> 00:09:24.148
The head of Zhaohan Sect

00:09:24.148 --> 00:09:26.109
loves making stuffed animals.

00:09:27.268 --> 00:09:28.788
No way!

00:09:29.189 --> 00:09:30.868
I did hear

00:09:30.868 --> 00:09:33.069
that their head enjoys collecting

00:09:33.069 --> 00:09:34.668
preserved plant specimens.

00:09:34.908 --> 00:09:37.508
But animals...

00:09:37.508 --> 00:09:38.988
I never expected

00:09:38.988 --> 00:09:40.549
her to be so cruel.

00:09:40.549 --> 00:09:41.829
Please save me.

00:09:41.829 --> 00:09:42.709
Save me.

00:09:45.148 --> 00:09:46.268
Well, then...

00:09:46.429 --> 00:09:48.949
How can I break this barrier?

00:09:48.949 --> 00:09:50.508
This barrier was set by Ling Bo

00:09:50.508 --> 00:09:51.589
personally.

00:09:51.708 --> 00:09:52.829
With a water spiritual root,

00:09:52.829 --> 00:09:54.668
she excels at turning water into ice.

00:09:54.668 --> 00:09:55.589
That's why the barrier

00:09:55.589 --> 00:09:57.148
is like eternal frost

00:09:57.148 --> 00:09:58.109
and indestructible.

00:09:58.109 --> 00:09:59.748
Not even true fire can break through.

00:10:01.148 --> 00:10:03.429
But there's one thing it fears.

00:10:04.388 --> 00:10:05.189
What?

00:10:05.908 --> 00:10:07.189
Tears.

00:10:07.788 --> 00:10:09.349
Tears?

00:10:11.028 --> 00:10:12.309
What are you trying to do?

00:10:13.388 --> 00:10:15.268
I am going to bed.

00:10:15.388 --> 00:10:16.268
Don't think I don't

00:10:16.268 --> 00:10:17.309
know what you're up to.

00:10:17.309 --> 00:10:19.388
We just got here,
and you're already after the maids.

00:10:19.628 --> 00:10:21.148
Your intentions are really...

00:10:21.309 --> 00:10:22.028
Master Zong,

00:10:22.189 --> 00:10:23.309
you can't really be pinning

00:10:23.309 --> 00:10:24.988
your hopes on Kong Hou, can you?

00:10:24.988 --> 00:10:25.549
Do you think

00:10:25.549 --> 00:10:26.388
she can get those

00:10:26.388 --> 00:10:27.148
bird feathers?

00:10:27.229 --> 00:10:28.788
Regardless of whether she gets them,

00:10:28.788 --> 00:10:30.268
you mustn't steal.

00:10:30.868 --> 00:10:32.229
Okay, okay, I get it.

00:10:32.388 --> 00:10:33.268
Get some rest early.

00:10:33.668 --> 00:10:34.988
I'm going back to sleep.

00:10:35.148 --> 00:10:35.949
No stealing!

00:10:35.949 --> 00:10:37.109
Got it. Good night.

00:11:01.709 --> 00:11:04.988
This phoenix is still just a bird.

00:11:05.229 --> 00:11:06.868
It should sleep in a cage.

00:11:07.189 --> 00:11:08.868
Why is there only one bed?

00:11:11.829 --> 00:11:13.349
Could it be...

00:11:25.868 --> 00:11:27.069
Why is it you?

00:11:27.069 --> 00:11:28.549
You shameless fool!

00:11:28.549 --> 00:11:30.309
First you tease my maids, and now...

00:11:30.748 --> 00:11:31.388
I...

00:11:32.309 --> 00:11:33.589
I'll kill you!

00:11:37.748 --> 00:11:40.109
I forced these tears out
with great effort.

00:11:40.268 --> 00:11:42.189
You'd better keep your promise.

00:11:42.189 --> 00:11:43.908
Once you leave this barrier,

00:11:44.028 --> 00:11:45.549
you must give me one

00:11:45.709 --> 00:11:47.589
of your feathers.

00:11:55.748 --> 00:11:56.709
It's fine if your strike

00:11:56.709 --> 00:11:57.949
splits me in half.

00:11:57.949 --> 00:11:59.469
But if you break the table,

00:11:59.469 --> 00:12:00.229
you'll have to pay.

00:12:00.229 --> 00:12:01.469
I can afford it.

00:12:02.748 --> 00:12:04.469
Wait, stop!

00:12:05.268 --> 00:12:06.268
Let me explain.

00:12:06.268 --> 00:12:07.028
I didn't mean

00:12:07.028 --> 00:12:07.829
to come this late.

00:12:07.829 --> 00:12:09.189
Besides, I didn't see anything.

00:12:09.189 --> 00:12:09.829
Oh, really?

00:12:09.829 --> 00:12:10.868
So you wanted to see?

00:12:10.868 --> 00:12:11.988
You lecher!

00:12:11.988 --> 00:12:13.388
Wait. Be reasonable, okay?

00:12:13.388 --> 00:12:13.949
You're still

00:12:13.949 --> 00:12:14.788
a Zhaohan Sect fairy,

00:12:14.788 --> 00:12:15.949
yet all you know is killing.

00:12:15.949 --> 00:12:17.109
If needed, I'll let you see

00:12:17.109 --> 00:12:17.949
me in return. Fair?

00:12:17.949 --> 00:12:19.549
Shameless! You fool!

00:12:19.549 --> 00:12:20.309
What'd you say?

00:12:20.309 --> 00:12:21.109
Don't leave!

00:12:21.109 --> 00:12:22.748
Give me a feather!

00:12:27.229 --> 00:12:28.148
You promised

00:12:28.148 --> 00:12:29.309
to give me a feather.

00:12:29.309 --> 00:12:30.109
You stupid bird!

00:12:30.109 --> 00:12:31.189
You broke your promise!

00:12:31.309 --> 00:12:33.028
We agreed on a feather!

00:12:33.028 --> 00:12:34.069
You really believed that?

00:12:34.069 --> 00:12:35.028
Bye, little fool.

00:12:35.028 --> 00:12:36.988
You stupid bird! Liar!

00:12:36.988 --> 00:12:37.988
Chase it now!

00:12:38.028 --> 00:12:39.429
- Yes, senior sister!
- Move, run!

00:12:46.109 --> 00:12:47.589
You let it escape?

00:12:47.908 --> 00:12:48.788
I just got here.

00:12:48.949 --> 00:12:50.069
So, it was you?

00:12:50.988 --> 00:12:53.868
I-I didn't.

00:12:54.549 --> 00:12:55.549
Kong Hou,

00:12:55.788 --> 00:12:56.988
is this some concealment spell

00:12:56.988 --> 00:12:58.469
you set up?

00:13:05.868 --> 00:13:08.148
Why were you messing
with concealment spell for no reason?

00:13:08.309 --> 00:13:09.868
You tricked me into going to her room.

00:13:09.949 --> 00:13:10.549
Master Zong,

00:13:10.628 --> 00:13:11.988
I told you we shouldn't

00:13:11.988 --> 00:13:12.628
teach her.

00:13:12.628 --> 00:13:13.469
But you insisted.

00:13:13.469 --> 00:13:14.709
You taught her the spells.

00:13:14.829 --> 00:13:16.069
Now you're being fooled by her.

00:13:16.069 --> 00:13:17.429
- I was...
- How dare you say that?

00:13:18.988 --> 00:13:21.549
You're in cahoots?

00:13:21.668 --> 00:13:22.549
What "cahoots"?

00:13:22.549 --> 00:13:23.868
I told you I just arrived.

00:13:24.028 --> 00:13:25.148
Who knows whether you

00:13:25.148 --> 00:13:26.309
sent him to distract me,

00:13:26.309 --> 00:13:27.788
- and her for the phoenix?
- I...

00:13:28.069 --> 00:13:30.028
Speak! What's your scheme?

00:13:30.469 --> 00:13:31.589
W-What are you doing?

00:13:34.589 --> 00:13:35.829
Ling Bo,

00:13:36.628 --> 00:13:39.229
drawing weapons over nothing

00:13:39.229 --> 00:13:41.109
benefits neither of us.

00:13:43.508 --> 00:13:45.709
(His cultivation is profound.)

00:13:45.868 --> 00:13:46.748
What right do you have

00:13:46.748 --> 00:13:47.788
to do this to Huan Zong?

00:13:47.788 --> 00:13:48.668
You wanted to make

00:13:48.668 --> 00:13:49.508
the phoenix

00:13:49.508 --> 00:13:50.868
into a specimen.

00:13:50.908 --> 00:13:52.429
It was begging me for help.

00:13:52.429 --> 00:13:53.589
Don't talk nonsense.

00:13:53.709 --> 00:13:55.028
The phoenix told me itself.

00:13:55.028 --> 00:13:56.109
Are you trying to deny it?

00:13:56.109 --> 00:13:56.788
Enough.

00:13:57.229 --> 00:13:58.829
This matter is too strange.

00:13:58.949 --> 00:14:00.589
If there are hidden details,

00:14:00.589 --> 00:14:03.109
we hope you won't conceal them.

00:14:05.268 --> 00:14:07.388
The phoenix deceived you all.

00:14:08.309 --> 00:14:09.788
Our prestigious Zhaohan Sect

00:14:09.788 --> 00:14:10.388
would never

00:14:10.388 --> 00:14:11.988
commit such heinous acts.

00:14:12.148 --> 00:14:13.268
If this were true,

00:14:13.268 --> 00:14:14.709
may heaven strike me dead first.

00:14:14.709 --> 00:14:15.709
(That's true.)

00:14:15.868 --> 00:14:17.148
(She helped me)

00:14:17.148 --> 00:14:18.589
(capture scavengers earlier.)

00:14:18.949 --> 00:14:20.469
(She's probably not evil.)

00:14:20.788 --> 00:14:22.388
Then why did you

00:14:22.388 --> 00:14:23.589
capture the phoenix?

00:14:24.549 --> 00:14:25.469
Mating.

00:14:25.589 --> 00:14:27.349
Mating? Well...

00:14:27.349 --> 00:14:29.229
Isn't that even more heinous?

00:14:29.349 --> 00:14:31.628
There's only one phoenix in the world.

00:14:31.628 --> 00:14:32.788
How would you mate it?

00:14:32.908 --> 00:14:34.189
Ten years ago,

00:14:34.189 --> 00:14:35.988
we found

00:14:35.988 --> 00:14:37.429
another female in the Fufeng realm.

00:14:37.508 --> 00:14:39.668
The phoenix's body holds treasures.

00:14:39.829 --> 00:14:41.309
If we manage to mate it...

00:14:41.429 --> 00:14:42.788
Wouldn't that benefit everyone?

00:14:42.788 --> 00:14:44.028
Why's it unwilling then?

00:14:45.109 --> 00:14:46.628
It doesn't like that female.

00:14:47.469 --> 00:14:48.349
Doesn't like...

00:14:48.349 --> 00:14:49.229
What's so funny?

00:14:50.788 --> 00:14:51.868
It seems to me

00:14:51.868 --> 00:14:53.469
you tried to steal it and failed.

00:14:54.709 --> 00:14:55.349
Who's stealing?

00:14:55.349 --> 00:14:56.589
If you can't get it back,

00:14:56.589 --> 00:14:57.748
I'll kill you all.

00:14:57.748 --> 00:14:59.028
Explain yourself properly.

00:14:59.028 --> 00:14:59.788
Who stole any bird?

00:14:59.788 --> 00:15:01.388
I told you. It's medicine.

00:15:01.508 --> 00:15:02.429
Huan Zong,

00:15:02.429 --> 00:15:03.668
do something.

00:15:03.668 --> 00:15:04.628
Save us.

00:15:04.628 --> 00:15:06.229
You caused this trouble.

00:15:06.229 --> 00:15:07.668
Now you want help?

00:15:09.148 --> 00:15:10.628
Fine, I'll think of something.

00:15:21.549 --> 00:15:23.028
With so many people here,

00:15:23.028 --> 00:15:24.469
they're not being helpful.

00:15:24.788 --> 00:15:25.628
These people

00:15:25.748 --> 00:15:26.429
are all here

00:15:26.429 --> 00:15:27.469
to flatter Zhaohan Sect.

00:15:27.549 --> 00:15:29.229
They're rogue cultivators
after all. How...

00:15:29.508 --> 00:15:30.549
What are you saying?

00:15:30.709 --> 00:15:31.748
We searched all night

00:15:31.748 --> 00:15:33.028
and didn't find anything.

00:15:33.189 --> 00:15:34.788
How dare you gossip here?

00:15:34.829 --> 00:15:35.668
Let's go.

00:15:43.949 --> 00:15:45.508
You lying bird.

00:15:45.829 --> 00:15:47.829
How dare you trick me?

00:15:47.829 --> 00:15:48.589
When I catch you,

00:15:48.589 --> 00:15:50.668
I'll pluck out every
last feather of yours!

00:15:50.668 --> 00:15:52.309
You pissed me off the most.

00:15:53.268 --> 00:15:54.868
Even a bird could fool you.

00:15:54.868 --> 00:15:56.229
Yet here you are picking flowers?

00:15:56.429 --> 00:15:57.469
I just wanted

00:15:57.469 --> 00:15:59.189
to gather food that birds love to eat.

00:15:59.309 --> 00:16:00.709
It's been starving all night.

00:16:00.709 --> 00:16:02.788
It might get hungry now.

00:16:02.949 --> 00:16:04.028
It won't eat

00:16:04.028 --> 00:16:05.429
your messy offerings.

00:16:06.069 --> 00:16:07.589
What does it prefer then?

00:16:17.388 --> 00:16:18.508
Thank you, Ling Bo.

00:16:20.148 --> 00:16:21.309
We await your guidance.

00:16:21.469 --> 00:16:22.109
What makes

00:16:22.109 --> 00:16:23.268
this fruit special?

00:16:23.589 --> 00:16:24.628
The phoenix

00:16:24.628 --> 00:16:25.469
is particular.

00:16:25.469 --> 00:16:26.868
It only eats this spiritual fruit.

00:16:27.109 --> 00:16:28.388
Near Qiu City,

00:16:28.388 --> 00:16:29.868
it only grows here.

00:16:31.868 --> 00:16:33.469
So you're implying

00:16:33.628 --> 00:16:35.189
if it wants to keep escaping,

00:16:35.709 --> 00:16:36.949
it needs to eat first.

00:16:36.949 --> 00:16:38.589
So it won't go far right now?

00:16:38.589 --> 00:16:39.309
Exactly.

00:16:39.549 --> 00:16:41.148
Let's split up and search.

00:16:41.988 --> 00:16:42.709
You,

00:16:44.028 --> 00:16:44.868
come with me.

00:16:45.028 --> 00:16:46.268
Until we find the phoenix,

00:16:46.268 --> 00:16:47.469
stay within my sight.

00:16:47.469 --> 00:16:48.589
Why me?

00:16:48.628 --> 00:16:49.829
Wait.

00:16:50.388 --> 00:16:52.109
Aside from being picky,

00:16:52.109 --> 00:16:53.309
any other habits?

00:16:54.268 --> 00:16:55.229
It's lustful.

00:16:58.309 --> 00:16:59.268
Go.

00:16:59.268 --> 00:16:59.988
I...

00:17:04.428 --> 00:17:05.228
Huan Zong,

00:17:05.388 --> 00:17:06.708
the bird's lustful.

00:17:07.349 --> 00:17:08.349
I heard that.

00:17:08.708 --> 00:17:10.029
Why emphasize that?

00:17:19.549 --> 00:17:20.349
Huan Zong,

00:17:20.428 --> 00:17:22.029
what's wrong with you?

00:17:22.349 --> 00:17:24.309
Did I upset you somehow?

00:17:24.549 --> 00:17:25.908
The phoenix's claw marks.

00:17:26.628 --> 00:17:28.309
It means it was here recently.

00:17:36.789 --> 00:17:38.309
You got clues on my face?

00:17:38.948 --> 00:17:39.948
No.

00:17:40.069 --> 00:17:42.069
Then stop distracting my search.

00:17:46.428 --> 00:17:48.029
Is it because I didn't send

00:17:48.029 --> 00:17:49.029
a messenger talisman

00:17:49.029 --> 00:17:50.349
and you got angry?

00:17:51.309 --> 00:17:52.109
No.

00:17:52.269 --> 00:17:53.069
Look.

00:17:53.069 --> 00:17:54.269
You're doing that thing again,

00:17:54.269 --> 00:17:56.349
grunting single-word replies.

00:17:56.708 --> 00:17:58.509
Let me explain.

00:17:58.509 --> 00:17:59.948
I didn't send messenger talismans

00:17:59.948 --> 00:18:01.589
because all my messenger talismans

00:18:01.589 --> 00:18:03.228
slipped into the river.

00:18:04.309 --> 00:18:05.309
Into the river?

00:18:05.309 --> 00:18:06.109
Yes.

00:18:06.668 --> 00:18:08.789
The wind was raging that day,

00:18:08.868 --> 00:18:10.269
blowing all my messenger talismans

00:18:10.309 --> 00:18:13.148
straight into the current.

00:18:13.148 --> 00:18:14.109
Liar.

00:18:14.309 --> 00:18:16.228
I'm not lying.

00:18:20.908 --> 00:18:22.148
You're angry.

00:18:22.388 --> 00:18:23.829
I'm furious too!

00:18:24.029 --> 00:18:26.269
Someone promised to contact me,

00:18:26.269 --> 00:18:27.109
but guess what?

00:18:27.109 --> 00:18:28.109
No messages at all.

00:18:28.309 --> 00:18:29.868
Someone made grand vows

00:18:29.868 --> 00:18:31.468
that if anything happens,

00:18:31.468 --> 00:18:33.029
he would just message me.

00:18:33.228 --> 00:18:33.908
Turns out

00:18:34.069 --> 00:18:36.109
it was all empty words.

00:18:36.269 --> 00:18:37.428
I did send messages.

00:18:39.708 --> 00:18:41.589
Then why didn't I get them?

00:18:41.789 --> 00:18:43.309
When did you send them?

00:18:44.349 --> 00:18:45.829
I'm not lying.

00:18:45.829 --> 00:18:47.069
I never received anything.

00:18:48.948 --> 00:18:50.388
What's going on?

00:18:50.628 --> 00:18:51.708
This makes no sense.

00:18:51.908 --> 00:18:53.428
Ask yourself that.

00:18:54.349 --> 00:18:55.549
Maybe they were also

00:18:55.708 --> 00:18:56.549
blown into the river

00:18:56.549 --> 00:18:57.468
like your talismans.

00:19:00.628 --> 00:19:01.428
Never mind.

00:19:01.789 --> 00:19:04.029
Let Huan Zong

00:19:04.029 --> 00:19:05.109
cool down first.

00:19:06.589 --> 00:19:07.628
Ridiculous!

00:19:07.628 --> 00:19:08.589
You

00:19:08.589 --> 00:19:10.029
got outsmarted by Kong Hou?

00:19:10.349 --> 00:19:11.388
Ling Bo,

00:19:11.549 --> 00:19:12.948
haven't you heard?

00:19:13.148 --> 00:19:15.029
Good swimmers drown,

00:19:15.029 --> 00:19:16.989
and big ships sink in puddles.

00:19:16.989 --> 00:19:18.188
I almost thought

00:19:18.188 --> 00:19:20.589
I'd see the Azure Phoenix.

00:19:20.749 --> 00:19:21.989
You confessed it yourself.

00:19:21.989 --> 00:19:23.509
I knew you coveted the phoenix

00:19:23.509 --> 00:19:24.388
with ill intentions.

00:19:25.069 --> 00:19:27.029
You flirted with Yue He first,

00:19:27.188 --> 00:19:28.908
and then broke into my chambers.

00:19:29.868 --> 00:19:30.708
No.

00:19:30.708 --> 00:19:31.948
I've explained to you.

00:19:31.948 --> 00:19:32.829
My feelings for you

00:19:32.829 --> 00:19:34.749
contain no improper thoughts whatsoever.

00:19:34.749 --> 00:19:35.549
You mustn't...

00:19:50.309 --> 00:19:51.468
There's a bird over there.

00:19:51.628 --> 00:19:52.428
It seems

00:19:52.428 --> 00:19:54.029
to be in a foul mood.

00:19:54.509 --> 00:19:55.668
Does it have expressions?

00:19:55.829 --> 00:19:57.349
How can you tell it's in a foul mood?

00:19:57.349 --> 00:19:58.868
I learned a bit

00:19:58.868 --> 00:20:00.269
of spiritual beast art

00:20:00.269 --> 00:20:01.309
from Master Pei Huai.

00:20:02.628 --> 00:20:04.989
How about we go ask it?

00:20:05.908 --> 00:20:06.989
How do we ask?

00:20:11.188 --> 00:20:12.069
Just try.

00:20:17.708 --> 00:20:18.749
Did you happen to see

00:20:18.749 --> 00:20:20.228
a phoenix yesterday?

00:20:20.228 --> 00:20:22.309
It looked rather peculiar.

00:20:22.468 --> 00:20:24.228
If you get the message,
please answer me.

00:20:32.388 --> 00:20:34.228
Yes, it was here.

00:20:34.349 --> 00:20:35.468
It fooled me and ran off

00:20:35.468 --> 00:20:36.668
after breaking my heart.

00:20:40.468 --> 00:20:42.549
That phoenix is truly lustful.

00:20:42.549 --> 00:20:44.109
Yesterday, it sweet-talked

00:20:44.109 --> 00:20:46.269
this poor female bird.

00:20:46.269 --> 00:20:48.309
Now it's long gone.

00:20:48.468 --> 00:20:49.829
You understand bird language too?

00:20:49.989 --> 00:20:51.549
I certainly don't.

00:20:51.549 --> 00:20:53.428
But I have this treasure.

00:20:53.589 --> 00:20:55.349
Master Pei Huai gave it to me.

00:20:55.549 --> 00:20:57.549
I can communicate
with normal spiritual beasts

00:20:57.549 --> 00:20:58.468
and birds through it.

00:20:58.468 --> 00:20:59.468
If you like it,

00:20:59.468 --> 00:21:00.269
I'll give it to you.

00:21:00.349 --> 00:21:01.349
None of that matters.

00:21:01.549 --> 00:21:02.789
The bird doesn't matter either.

00:21:02.789 --> 00:21:04.989
What matters now is finding the phoenix.

00:21:08.468 --> 00:21:09.989
Have you heard the saying

00:21:10.148 --> 00:21:13.029
"Lust clouds judgment"?

00:21:14.668 --> 00:21:15.749
Why are you pulling me?

00:21:15.749 --> 00:21:16.349
Let go.

00:21:17.349 --> 00:21:18.749
Do you think I want to pull you?

00:21:18.749 --> 00:21:19.829
You were about to fall.

00:21:19.829 --> 00:21:21.228
You're the one who pulled me.

00:21:23.388 --> 00:21:24.309
You're so annoying.

00:21:25.029 --> 00:21:26.188
You're calling me annoying?

00:21:26.188 --> 00:21:27.309
I'm the annoyed one here!

00:21:27.309 --> 00:21:28.188
Don't you dare

00:21:28.188 --> 00:21:29.029
get me wrong.

00:21:29.029 --> 00:21:29.708
People may think

00:21:29.708 --> 00:21:30.708
I did something to you.

00:21:30.708 --> 00:21:31.509
Don't you dare think

00:21:31.509 --> 00:21:32.388
I want to do anything

00:21:32.408 --> 00:21:32.908
or like you.

00:21:32.908 --> 00:21:34.868
- I...
- Let me tell you. I don't...

00:21:43.989 --> 00:21:46.188
You're a demon cultivator?

00:21:46.789 --> 00:21:47.948
What's wrong with that?

00:21:48.109 --> 00:21:48.868
Nothing.

00:21:49.069 --> 00:21:49.989
It's just that I

00:21:49.989 --> 00:21:52.029
have always despised
demon cultivators most.

00:21:52.148 --> 00:21:53.789
You're weaker than a demon cultivator.

00:21:53.948 --> 00:21:54.948
- How infuriating is that?
- You...

00:22:09.989 --> 00:22:11.509
Huan Zong, look.

00:22:11.829 --> 00:22:13.228
Will this really work?

00:22:13.549 --> 00:22:14.829
Of course.

00:22:15.029 --> 00:22:17.188
Look at this head, this body

00:22:17.349 --> 00:22:18.309
and these claws.

00:22:18.509 --> 00:22:20.668
Doesn't it resemble
a charming female bird?

00:22:21.029 --> 00:22:22.829
Relax and watch.

00:22:23.029 --> 00:22:25.109
It'll definitely attract

00:22:25.109 --> 00:22:26.309
that phoenix.

00:22:26.908 --> 00:22:28.309
Then I'll wait and see.

00:22:30.109 --> 00:22:31.468
There's an extra flower here.

00:22:31.468 --> 00:22:33.388
Should I show you another trick?

00:22:33.668 --> 00:22:35.188
You've known me for so long.

00:22:35.188 --> 00:22:36.948
I'm much stronger now than before.

00:22:40.628 --> 00:22:41.668
Turn into a butterfly.

00:22:45.868 --> 00:22:47.109
Where's the butterfly?

00:22:48.188 --> 00:22:50.069
L-Let me check.

00:22:50.069 --> 00:22:51.349
Could it be

00:22:51.349 --> 00:22:53.468
I chanted the wrong spell?

00:22:53.468 --> 00:22:54.668
No way.

00:22:55.228 --> 00:22:56.468
W-What...

00:22:58.148 --> 00:22:59.029
Bee!

00:23:10.428 --> 00:23:11.989
Let me tell you again.

00:23:12.829 --> 00:23:14.549
I don't know why,

00:23:14.708 --> 00:23:15.948
but I truly didn't receive

00:23:16.029 --> 00:23:17.349
your message talisman.

00:23:17.749 --> 00:23:19.789
I didn't ignore you on purpose.

00:23:20.269 --> 00:23:22.148
Then can you get up and talk properly?

00:23:22.628 --> 00:23:23.829
But I've always wanted

00:23:23.829 --> 00:23:24.789
to talk to you properly.

00:23:24.789 --> 00:23:26.109
You ignored me first.

00:23:26.269 --> 00:23:27.749
This position works fine too.

00:23:27.749 --> 00:23:28.989
At least you'll behave.

00:23:28.989 --> 00:23:31.829
You are already injured,

00:23:32.349 --> 00:23:33.549
yet you still

00:23:34.349 --> 00:23:35.628
get so angry.

00:23:35.628 --> 00:23:37.148
Aren't you worsening your condition?

00:23:37.628 --> 00:23:38.908
I asked you to regulate energy.

00:23:38.908 --> 00:23:40.188
But you refused to do that.

00:23:40.388 --> 00:23:41.388
Take care

00:23:41.388 --> 00:23:42.388
of yourself properly.

00:23:42.388 --> 00:23:43.708
So you won't make me worry.

00:23:45.989 --> 00:23:47.908
Are you that eager
to regulate energy with me?

00:23:48.228 --> 00:23:49.309
Of course!

00:23:49.708 --> 00:23:50.948
I've seen you before,

00:23:50.948 --> 00:23:52.708
suffering alone while regulating energy.

00:23:53.188 --> 00:23:54.069
But

00:23:54.349 --> 00:23:55.789
even if it's painful,

00:23:56.228 --> 00:23:58.148
you still refuse
to regulate energy with me.

00:23:58.309 --> 00:24:00.269
Fine, if you don't want
to do that, then don't.

00:24:00.269 --> 00:24:01.269
Anyway, my master

00:24:01.269 --> 00:24:02.948
already sealed my acupoints.

00:24:03.029 --> 00:24:04.868
Even if I wanted to,

00:24:04.868 --> 00:24:06.628
I might not be able to do that.

00:24:06.628 --> 00:24:07.269
Your master

00:24:07.269 --> 00:24:08.948
really sealed your acupoints?

00:24:08.948 --> 00:24:09.789
Yes.

00:24:09.948 --> 00:24:11.509
He said if not,

00:24:11.509 --> 00:24:13.069
he wouldn't let me leave the mountain.

00:24:13.109 --> 00:24:14.188
But it's fine.

00:24:14.188 --> 00:24:15.549
We can work together.

00:24:15.549 --> 00:24:16.948
Let's collect all those

00:24:16.948 --> 00:24:18.428
medicinal ingredients.

00:24:20.868 --> 00:24:22.868
You're not mad at me now?

00:24:22.868 --> 00:24:24.148
Could you stop pinning me down?

00:24:25.188 --> 00:24:26.069
Oh, right.

00:24:26.309 --> 00:24:28.029
Let's find that phoenix now.

00:24:28.029 --> 00:24:29.668
Its feathers are too precious to ignore.

00:24:34.948 --> 00:24:36.908
Since you're a demon cultivator,
smell this.

00:24:41.188 --> 00:24:42.109
Isn't it the bowl

00:24:42.109 --> 00:24:43.029
of that phoenix?

00:24:43.029 --> 00:24:43.948
Why make me smell it?

00:24:44.349 --> 00:24:45.789
I left in a hurry

00:24:45.789 --> 00:24:46.789
without hunting dogs.

00:24:46.789 --> 00:24:47.749
Your nose

00:24:47.749 --> 00:24:49.148
should work just as well.

00:24:51.468 --> 00:24:52.829
Anyway,

00:24:52.829 --> 00:24:54.228
this phoenix is a demon.

00:24:54.428 --> 00:24:55.989
It's hidden its aura since leaving.

00:24:56.188 --> 00:24:57.668
Even if I could detect it,

00:24:58.188 --> 00:24:59.269
I wouldn't help you.

00:25:01.228 --> 00:25:02.269
You think the phoenix

00:25:02.269 --> 00:25:03.388
is an idiot?

00:25:03.388 --> 00:25:05.309
Even if it didn't hide its aura,

00:25:05.428 --> 00:25:06.228
all your perfumes

00:25:06.228 --> 00:25:07.989
along the way

00:25:07.989 --> 00:25:09.228
would have masked it all.

00:25:09.428 --> 00:25:11.228
Even if I want, I can't detect it.

00:25:13.228 --> 00:25:13.789
You...

00:25:13.948 --> 00:25:14.789
What are you doing?

00:25:14.789 --> 00:25:15.708
Are you serious?

00:25:15.989 --> 00:25:16.668
What?

00:25:16.668 --> 00:25:17.428
Stay still.

00:25:55.708 --> 00:25:59.468
Blossoms swaying, willows bending.

00:25:59.708 --> 00:26:03.349
Dewdrops falling, peonies blooming.

00:26:03.789 --> 00:26:08.109
Bees sip honey, hearts...

00:26:08.109 --> 00:26:10.228
Are you sure the bird likes this song?

00:26:11.589 --> 00:26:14.309
We're luring the bird into our trap.

00:26:14.309 --> 00:26:16.589
Naturally, we cater to its preferences.

00:26:16.948 --> 00:26:18.468
Where did you learn all this?

00:26:19.349 --> 00:26:21.228
From Master Writer's storybooks.

00:26:21.428 --> 00:26:22.388
Practical application.

00:26:22.589 --> 00:26:23.468
I don't think

00:26:23.468 --> 00:26:24.829
he would approve of this.

00:26:30.069 --> 00:26:32.628
Why hasn't the phoenix come yet?

00:26:32.708 --> 00:26:33.509
Could it be

00:26:33.628 --> 00:26:35.789
it thinks my song is too direct?

00:26:37.549 --> 00:26:38.668
That can't be.

00:26:40.148 --> 00:26:44.428
One tilts her cloud-like hair,

00:26:44.668 --> 00:26:48.789
heedless of the falling hairpin.

00:26:49.668 --> 00:26:51.549
Was this line also written
by Master Writer?

00:26:52.388 --> 00:26:53.388
Of course not.

00:26:53.589 --> 00:26:55.509
This was written by his rival.

00:26:55.668 --> 00:26:57.029
He has rivals?

00:27:05.549 --> 00:27:06.309
Master Zong.

00:27:22.948 --> 00:27:24.668
Come into my treasure pouch now.

00:27:26.708 --> 00:27:27.589
Got it!

00:27:27.749 --> 00:27:28.789
Got it! We got it!

00:27:29.589 --> 00:27:31.468
Now that we've caught the phoenix,

00:27:31.468 --> 00:27:32.708
let's all

00:27:32.708 --> 00:27:33.349
play a game

00:27:33.349 --> 00:27:34.388
to relax.

00:27:35.549 --> 00:27:37.948
I'll demonstrate or describe something,

00:27:38.109 --> 00:27:39.428
and you all guess what it is.

00:27:39.428 --> 00:27:40.708
Huan Zong, you join too.

00:27:40.948 --> 00:27:41.668
Alright.

00:27:42.509 --> 00:27:44.148
Okay, starting now.

00:27:44.188 --> 00:27:44.948
First question.

00:27:47.468 --> 00:27:48.789
- The phoenix.
- The phoenix.

00:27:48.789 --> 00:27:49.789
Twirling lotus pose!

00:27:49.829 --> 00:27:51.069
Phoenix! Phoenix!

00:27:51.069 --> 00:27:51.868
Right? Am I right?

00:27:51.868 --> 00:27:53.309
Correct! Second question.

00:27:56.708 --> 00:27:57.208
This one...

00:27:57.388 --> 00:27:59.069
- Snowy owl!
- Is it a snowy owl?

00:27:59.069 --> 00:27:59.628
Snowy owl.

00:28:02.789 --> 00:28:03.589
A word.

00:28:05.549 --> 00:28:06.269
Why leave?

00:28:06.269 --> 00:28:06.989
What's going on?

00:28:06.989 --> 00:28:08.428
I knew something was wrong.

00:28:11.948 --> 00:28:13.148
You reveal it?

00:28:13.468 --> 00:28:14.349
About me.

00:28:14.349 --> 00:28:15.349
You told them?

00:28:15.708 --> 00:28:16.708
What is it?

00:28:16.708 --> 00:28:17.428
Well...

00:28:19.708 --> 00:28:20.989
About that day when you...

00:28:21.749 --> 00:28:22.708
Stop talking.

00:28:24.428 --> 00:28:25.549
I keep my promises.

00:28:25.549 --> 00:28:27.148
How could I possibly reveal it?

00:28:27.148 --> 00:28:28.749
So your final question earlier

00:28:28.749 --> 00:28:29.708
was not about that?

00:28:30.069 --> 00:28:31.549
That last question earlier?

00:28:31.549 --> 00:28:32.989
The answer was a snowy owl.

00:28:32.989 --> 00:28:33.868
Didn't everyone get

00:28:33.948 --> 00:28:34.789
the answer already?

00:28:34.789 --> 00:28:37.029
I meant the sound you mimic

00:28:37.029 --> 00:28:38.428
with those spiritual fruits.

00:28:38.589 --> 00:28:39.668
The call of a snowy owl

00:28:39.668 --> 00:28:40.468
sounds like that.

00:28:41.868 --> 00:28:42.948
Alright.

00:28:43.349 --> 00:28:45.309
The Azure Phoenix is rare.

00:28:45.309 --> 00:28:46.628
Once I escort the phoenix

00:28:46.628 --> 00:28:47.628
back to the inn,

00:28:47.628 --> 00:28:48.829
I'll give you a feather.

00:28:49.749 --> 00:28:50.708
Really?

00:28:51.069 --> 00:28:52.069
That's awesome!

00:28:52.069 --> 00:28:52.908
Only one feather.

00:28:52.908 --> 00:28:54.029
Don't push your luck.

00:28:54.029 --> 00:28:54.948
Alright, alright!

00:28:55.148 --> 00:28:56.349
One feather.

00:28:56.349 --> 00:28:57.789
One will suffice.

00:28:58.749 --> 00:28:59.829
Why are you here?

00:29:00.749 --> 00:29:02.668
Master Zong sensed
someone following you,

00:29:02.749 --> 00:29:03.668
so he came to check

00:29:03.668 --> 00:29:04.628
for your safety.

00:29:04.829 --> 00:29:06.188
What were you discussing merrily?

00:29:06.388 --> 00:29:07.069
Nothing.

00:29:07.349 --> 00:29:08.069
Tell us.

00:29:08.069 --> 00:29:08.829
It's nothing.

00:29:08.829 --> 00:29:09.789
Look.

00:29:11.388 --> 00:29:12.228
Someone broke

00:29:12.228 --> 00:29:12.908
my mechanism.

00:29:13.589 --> 00:29:14.549
My feather!

00:29:22.188 --> 00:29:22.908
Ling Bo.

00:29:23.269 --> 00:29:23.829
This...

00:29:24.468 --> 00:29:25.188
What's wrong?

00:29:25.188 --> 00:29:26.029
What's happening?

00:29:26.029 --> 00:29:26.908
Why is everyone...

00:29:27.029 --> 00:29:27.908
It's a sedative.

00:29:28.089 --> 00:29:28.589
Even we

00:29:28.589 --> 00:29:29.549
can barely hold on.

00:29:29.549 --> 00:29:30.549
How can you, a beginner,

00:29:30.549 --> 00:29:31.749
appear completely unaffected?

00:29:31.749 --> 00:29:32.428
Before leaving,

00:29:32.428 --> 00:29:33.549
my master gave me

00:29:33.549 --> 00:29:34.388
a special elixir

00:29:34.388 --> 00:29:35.829
that makes me immune to all poisons.

00:29:35.829 --> 00:29:37.589
I thought he was lying.

00:29:49.989 --> 00:29:51.349
It's you?

00:29:51.549 --> 00:29:52.829
You hid your cultivation level.

00:29:53.029 --> 00:29:54.228
You're above Nascent Soul.

00:29:54.228 --> 00:29:55.188
Who are you?

00:29:59.668 --> 00:30:00.589
Lin Hu, Kong Hou.

00:30:00.589 --> 00:30:01.628
Stay here.

00:30:01.628 --> 00:30:02.349
I'll chase him.

00:30:02.349 --> 00:30:03.228
- Wait!
- I'll go with you!

00:30:13.908 --> 00:30:14.908
Don't let him escape!

00:30:20.148 --> 00:30:21.428
You bird thief!

00:30:26.908 --> 00:30:28.069
(Frost Poison?)

00:30:31.029 --> 00:30:32.029
(No other choice.)

00:30:32.029 --> 00:30:32.908
(I must cure her now.)

00:30:32.989 --> 00:30:33.948
Forgive my intrusion.

00:30:46.611 --> 00:30:54.080
(Guests Feel At Home,
Guests Flock Like Clouds)

00:31:02.708 --> 00:31:05.069
Huan Zong. Huan Zong.

00:31:06.188 --> 00:31:07.069
You're awake.

00:31:10.989 --> 00:31:12.989
Huan Zong, where's the phoenix?

00:31:12.989 --> 00:31:13.948
Ling Bo promised me

00:31:13.948 --> 00:31:15.029
that once we catch it,

00:31:15.029 --> 00:31:16.309
she'd give me a feather.

00:31:18.509 --> 00:31:19.948
You want its feather so much?

00:31:19.948 --> 00:31:20.829
Of course!

00:31:20.948 --> 00:31:21.789
It's an ingredient

00:31:21.789 --> 00:31:22.829
in your medicine formula.

00:31:22.989 --> 00:31:23.549
Huan Zong.

00:31:24.228 --> 00:31:24.868
How is it?

00:31:24.868 --> 00:31:26.228
Did you catch the phoenix?

00:31:27.589 --> 00:31:28.309
Yes.

00:31:29.029 --> 00:31:29.708
Here it is.

00:31:30.789 --> 00:31:31.789
Ling Bo sent it over

00:31:31.789 --> 00:31:32.668
after we got here.

00:31:36.269 --> 00:31:37.109
That's good.

00:31:42.948 --> 00:31:43.789
Kong Hou.

00:31:44.029 --> 00:31:44.789
Though I helped you

00:31:44.789 --> 00:31:46.188
clear the frost poison,

00:31:46.388 --> 00:31:47.668
your cultivation is weak.

00:31:47.868 --> 00:31:49.388
You need time to recuperate.

00:31:49.829 --> 00:31:51.148
Also, let me remind you.

00:31:51.829 --> 00:31:53.188
You've just left the sect.

00:31:53.388 --> 00:31:55.069
These dark cultivators are cunning,

00:31:55.069 --> 00:31:56.309
full of wicked schemes.

00:31:56.668 --> 00:31:58.269
You need to be more vigilant next time.

00:31:58.269 --> 00:31:59.549
Don't let your guard down

00:31:59.549 --> 00:32:01.269
and charge ahead recklessly.

00:32:01.708 --> 00:32:02.509
Understood.

00:32:17.349 --> 00:32:18.749
Let me make this clear first.

00:32:18.989 --> 00:32:20.309
That was an emergency.

00:32:20.309 --> 00:32:21.069
So I did that.

00:32:21.388 --> 00:32:23.029
I-I know.

00:32:23.468 --> 00:32:25.948
But that was my first kiss.

00:32:25.948 --> 00:32:27.069
Are you kidding me?

00:32:27.069 --> 00:32:28.309
It was just a brief touch.

00:32:29.029 --> 00:32:30.388
Just a brief touch?

00:32:30.388 --> 00:32:31.188
We...

00:32:31.188 --> 00:32:32.749
My lips hurt.

00:32:32.749 --> 00:32:33.668
How could I draw it out

00:32:33.668 --> 00:32:34.549
without force?

00:32:34.628 --> 00:32:35.468
Besides,

00:32:35.668 --> 00:32:37.668
if you went to a physician
while injured,

00:32:37.668 --> 00:32:38.269
he'd

00:32:38.269 --> 00:32:39.549
remove your clothing. Then...

00:32:39.549 --> 00:32:40.989
Stop talking!

00:32:51.029 --> 00:32:52.549
You poisoned people

00:32:52.789 --> 00:32:54.228
and stole Zhaohan Sect's phoenix.

00:32:54.428 --> 00:32:55.628
You used despicable methods

00:32:55.628 --> 00:32:56.668
and acted rampantly.

00:32:56.868 --> 00:32:58.509
Speak! Who are you really?

00:32:58.509 --> 00:32:59.789
Why steal the phoenix?

00:33:00.668 --> 00:33:01.628
Stop laughing!

00:33:01.628 --> 00:33:02.948
I don't have time to waste.

00:33:03.148 --> 00:33:04.428
If you confess now,

00:33:04.428 --> 00:33:05.749
I might spare your life.

00:33:05.908 --> 00:33:06.628
The crowd outside

00:33:06.628 --> 00:33:08.029
are those you've wronged.

00:33:08.428 --> 00:33:09.589
If I throw you out there,

00:33:09.589 --> 00:33:10.468
they'll pummel you,

00:33:10.468 --> 00:33:11.708
making your death miserable.

00:33:13.708 --> 00:33:15.148
Why go through the hassle?

00:33:16.428 --> 00:33:17.109
This.

00:33:17.549 --> 00:33:18.148
This.

00:33:18.628 --> 00:33:19.549
Recognize this?

00:33:20.029 --> 00:33:21.349
Luanfeng Peak

00:33:21.349 --> 00:33:23.069
has certain methods
for dark cultivators.

00:33:23.069 --> 00:33:25.428
I'm sure you've heard the stories.

00:33:25.628 --> 00:33:26.948
Now that you're

00:33:26.948 --> 00:33:28.309
in Zhaohan Sect's custody.

00:33:28.509 --> 00:33:29.388
Ling Bo is graciously

00:33:29.388 --> 00:33:30.749
offering you a chance.

00:33:30.749 --> 00:33:32.388
If you cooperate fully,

00:33:32.388 --> 00:33:33.829
we'll keep this civilized.

00:33:34.029 --> 00:33:35.549
If you refuse to cooperate,

00:33:37.029 --> 00:33:38.428
we'll handle it our way.

00:33:38.908 --> 00:33:40.468
You won't like our methods.

00:33:50.948 --> 00:33:51.668
By the way,

00:33:53.989 --> 00:33:55.668
why are you so calm?

00:33:56.628 --> 00:33:58.549
Do you kiss people often?

00:33:58.549 --> 00:33:59.908
Of course not!

00:34:01.228 --> 00:34:03.989
So that was your first time too?

00:34:12.148 --> 00:34:14.268
You're already this old,

00:34:14.589 --> 00:34:16.109
and it was your first kiss?

00:34:17.268 --> 00:34:18.788
Oh, please.

00:34:18.788 --> 00:34:19.869
You should rest more.

00:34:19.869 --> 00:34:20.949
Get some proper rest.

00:34:22.228 --> 00:34:23.188
Huan Zong,

00:34:23.348 --> 00:34:24.429
let me ask you.

00:34:24.668 --> 00:34:25.708
Have you ever

00:34:25.708 --> 00:34:27.909
been with someone before?

00:34:28.989 --> 00:34:29.909
Why ask that?

00:34:30.228 --> 00:34:31.989
I-I'm just curious.

00:34:31.989 --> 00:34:32.949
Curiosity.

00:34:33.469 --> 00:34:34.429
Curious?

00:34:34.628 --> 00:34:35.628
I won't tell you.

00:34:36.748 --> 00:34:38.469
Then you haven't.

00:34:38.469 --> 00:34:39.509
You hadn't kissed.

00:34:39.949 --> 00:34:42.429
Not kissing doesn't mean anything, okay?

00:34:45.909 --> 00:34:47.668
People who truly love each other

00:34:47.668 --> 00:34:48.909
always kiss.

00:34:49.708 --> 00:34:50.509
An expert now?

00:34:50.589 --> 00:34:51.989
I read it in storybooks.

00:34:52.469 --> 00:34:53.469
Master Writer's books

00:34:53.469 --> 00:34:54.429
don't mention that.

00:34:54.628 --> 00:34:55.748
I meant those

00:34:55.748 --> 00:34:57.748
romance storybooks.

00:34:57.748 --> 00:34:59.069
Those stories clearly say

00:34:59.069 --> 00:35:00.869
when true lovers

00:35:00.869 --> 00:35:01.668
meet each other,

00:35:01.668 --> 00:35:03.308
their hearts race,

00:35:03.308 --> 00:35:04.069
and then

00:35:04.069 --> 00:35:05.549
they long to kiss.

00:35:05.748 --> 00:35:06.949
Such storybooks

00:35:06.949 --> 00:35:07.869
mislead people.

00:35:07.869 --> 00:35:09.268
You should discard them.

00:35:10.389 --> 00:35:12.148
Maybe one day,

00:35:12.148 --> 00:35:13.949
you might crave them yourself.

00:35:14.469 --> 00:35:15.308
Actually, I...

00:35:15.429 --> 00:35:16.188
I am...

00:35:18.308 --> 00:35:19.148
What?

00:35:22.109 --> 00:35:22.909
Don't.

00:35:22.949 --> 00:35:24.109
What's wrong with him?

00:35:25.949 --> 00:35:27.109
What happened?

00:35:31.708 --> 00:35:33.228
Useless trash.

00:35:33.308 --> 00:35:34.909
Can't even steal a phoenix.

00:36:06.348 --> 00:36:07.469
Where's that cultivator?

00:36:07.469 --> 00:36:09.029
Wasn't he locked up here earlier?

00:36:12.628 --> 00:36:13.509
It's a puppet.

00:36:13.509 --> 00:36:14.828
He self-destructed just now.

00:36:14.828 --> 00:36:15.869
That's how he ended up.

00:36:16.228 --> 00:36:17.509
I never expected

00:36:17.869 --> 00:36:19.429
this guy was actually a puppet.

00:36:19.828 --> 00:36:20.549
But

00:36:20.549 --> 00:36:21.429
how could anyone

00:36:21.429 --> 00:36:22.668
turn a living person

00:36:22.828 --> 00:36:24.268
into a puppet?

00:36:24.389 --> 00:36:25.869
That's utterly cruel.

00:36:26.069 --> 00:36:27.429
Must be dark cultivators' doing.

00:36:27.668 --> 00:36:29.268
If they'd stolen the phoenix, fine.

00:36:29.348 --> 00:36:30.389
But failing that,

00:36:30.389 --> 00:36:32.148
they just crushed him
to destroy evidence.

00:36:40.308 --> 00:36:41.069
Brother,

00:36:41.188 --> 00:36:42.869
the Lord will return soon.

00:36:43.188 --> 00:36:44.949
Without the Azure Phoenix,

00:36:45.509 --> 00:36:47.069
what should we do in the future?

00:36:47.429 --> 00:36:49.308
Naturally, we must prepare

00:36:49.828 --> 00:36:51.668
other grand gifts for the Lord.

00:36:55.389 --> 00:36:57.748
I just reported the situation
to the sect.

00:36:57.949 --> 00:36:59.469
They should soon

00:36:59.469 --> 00:37:00.069
find leads.

00:37:03.188 --> 00:37:04.308
Strangely enough,

00:37:04.628 --> 00:37:05.869
do you think those puppets

00:37:05.869 --> 00:37:07.148
self-destructed for no reason?

00:37:09.389 --> 00:37:10.228
I'm wondering

00:37:10.989 --> 00:37:13.109
what these dark cultivators really want.

00:37:13.389 --> 00:37:14.828
The trail ends here.

00:37:15.069 --> 00:37:16.549
With Jiusu dead,

00:37:16.748 --> 00:37:18.148
who knows what the dark cultivators

00:37:18.148 --> 00:37:19.188
are so arrogant about.

00:37:19.429 --> 00:37:21.109
Better safe than sorry.

00:37:22.069 --> 00:37:22.949
Yes.

00:37:22.989 --> 00:37:24.228
It seems this journey

00:37:24.429 --> 00:37:26.389
won't be peaceful.

00:37:26.589 --> 00:37:27.708
Finding the medicine first.

00:37:28.148 --> 00:37:29.308
You may leave now.

00:37:29.589 --> 00:37:30.188
Yes.

00:37:36.389 --> 00:37:37.148
Ling Bo.

00:37:38.828 --> 00:37:39.989
As you instructed,

00:37:39.989 --> 00:37:41.228
we've sent messages

00:37:41.228 --> 00:37:42.589
about the incident to the sect.

00:37:42.589 --> 00:37:43.869
The Azure Phoenix carriage

00:37:43.869 --> 00:37:44.828
is ready.

00:37:44.828 --> 00:37:46.029
We can depart anytime.

00:37:46.029 --> 00:37:46.708
Good.

00:37:46.949 --> 00:37:48.708
With dark cultivators
appearing suddenly,

00:37:48.708 --> 00:37:50.188
be extra cautious on the road.

00:37:50.188 --> 00:37:51.188
Don't let other sects

00:37:51.188 --> 00:37:52.549
look down on our Zhaohan Sect.

00:37:52.748 --> 00:37:53.389
Understood.

00:37:59.828 --> 00:38:01.069
Thank you for what happened

00:38:01.069 --> 00:38:01.748
yesterday.

00:38:03.029 --> 00:38:05.708
So you know how to say thank you.

00:38:16.949 --> 00:38:18.188
What's so funny?

00:38:18.188 --> 00:38:18.909
Nothing.

00:38:18.909 --> 00:38:19.949
I just think

00:38:19.949 --> 00:38:21.828
after such a major incident yesterday,

00:38:21.828 --> 00:38:22.989
you can still

00:38:22.989 --> 00:38:24.628
maintain such grandeur

00:38:24.869 --> 00:38:26.389
and such grace today.

00:38:26.708 --> 00:38:27.549
It is impressive.

00:38:27.748 --> 00:38:28.668
Look at you,

00:38:28.668 --> 00:38:30.148
so clueless about the world.

00:38:30.389 --> 00:38:32.469
This is the bearing of a major sect.

00:38:32.828 --> 00:38:33.429
Okay.

00:38:33.429 --> 00:38:35.188
Ling Bo, the fairy
with a major sect bearing,

00:38:35.228 --> 00:38:35.828
farewell.

00:38:36.308 --> 00:38:37.429
Hope we never meet again.

00:38:38.748 --> 00:38:39.469
Let's go.

00:38:47.828 --> 00:38:49.389
Someone outside, right?

00:38:49.589 --> 00:38:51.069
Come help now.

